OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMedic's memories 'vivid' after
OL,4,Atreating 9/11 victims
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We saw a flash of what then turned out
OL,7,Fto be the second plane hitting the
OL,8,Ftower," he said. "The pilot then
OL,9,Fstopped the plane and said that 'I'm
OL,10,Fafraid there's going to be a delay
OL,11,Fbecause there's been a terrible
OL,12,Faccident'," Sam added.
